<view class="orders-page">
  <view class="title">护肤品订单</view>
  <scroll-view scroll-x class="tabs-scroll">
    <view class="tabs">
      <view wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="id" class="tab {{status===item.id?'active':''}}" data-status="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select">{{item.name}}</view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view wx:if="{{visible.length}}">
    <view wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="id" class="order-card">
      <text>{{item.productName}}</text><text>{{item.statusName}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:else class="empty">
    <view class="empty-icon">▧</view>
    <view class="empty-title">暂无{{statusName==='全部'?'':statusName}}护肤品订单</view>
    <view class="empty-text">购买申请和订单数据库尚未接通。正式上线后，顾客在护肤品详情提交购买申请，这里才会出现对应订单与快递信息。</view>
    <button class="action" bindtap="shopping">浏览护肤品</button>
  </view>
  <view class="tip">此页面只显示护肤品订单。美容预约记录请在底部「预约详情」查看。</view>
</view>
